  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: Hi! I’m Whitney!\r",
        "...You!\n",
        "I saw you at the Radio Tower just now.\r",
        "Everyone was into Pokémon, so I got\n",
        "into it, too!\r",
        "Pokémon are super cute!\r",
        "You want to battle?\f",
        "I’m warning you--I’m good!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: Sob...\r",
        "...Waaaaaaah!\n",
        "You’re mean!\r",
        "You shouldn’t be so serious!\n",
        "You...you child, you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: Waaaaah!\r",
        "Waaaaah!\r",
        "...Snivel, hic.\n",
        "...You meanie!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: Sniff...\r",
        "What? What do you want? A Badge?\r",
        "Oh, right. I forgot.\n",
        "Here’s the Plain Badge.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Plain Badge from Whitney."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: The Plain Badge lets your\n",
        "Pokémon use Strength outside\f",
        "of battle.\r",
        "Oh, you can have this, too!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00006",
      "garbage": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: It’s Attract!\n",
        "It makes full use of a Pokémon’s charm.\r",
        "Isn’t it just perfect for a cutie\n",
        "like me?\f",
        "That’s right!\r",
        "I heard that this thing called the\n",
        "Pokéathlon Dome is now open right next\f",
        "to the National Park.\r",
        "You should go try it, since you’re\n",
        "so good at battling with your Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: Ah, that was a good cry!\r",
        "Come for a visit again! Bye-bye!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, no. You made Whitney cry.\r",
        "It’s OK. She’ll stop soon.\n",
        "She always cries when she loses.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo! Champ in the making!\r",
        "This Gym is home to Normal-type\n",
        "Pokémon Trainers.\r",
        "I recommend you use Fighting-type\n",
        "Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "You won? Great! I was busy admiring\n",
        "the powerful Trainers here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0582_T25GYM0101_00012",
      "en_US": "Goldenrod City Pokémon Gym"
    },
    {
